    {
      "url": "https://www.chef-sake.com/about_us",
      "title": "ABOUT US | chef-sake",
      "text": "top of pageSkip to Main Content\n \n \n \n\n \n \n \n\nCHEF SAKE'SHOMEABOUT USCONTACTMENUStartersSignature MenuMaki Roll MenuHibachi MenuMoreUse tab to navigate through the menu items.OUR STORY\nChef Sakes Restaurant and Sushi Bar focuses to serve guests with unique, fresh and flavorful dishes and everyone is welcomed as family and friends. For more than a decade, our chef, Chef Sake is a renowned sushi chef who has delivered his innovative approach to sushi making craft in Mobile. Using the very best ingredients; combined with traditional Japanese cooking techniques, makes Chef Sakes Restaurant and Sushi Bars offers flavors of authentic Japanese cuisine with a twist of fusion that has been taken to a higher level. Enjoy a glass of sake or beer that has been carefully selected to compliment the spices and sauces in Japanese cuisine. \n\n \n\nChef Sakes Restaurant and Sushi Bar is located across from University of South Alabama campus. Please enjoy yourselves as you relax in the exciting and romantic atmosphere we've created for you. Let our experienced servers know how we can make your dining experience more enjoyable or if there are any questions you might have about our menu.\nbottom of page",
